{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We, the Ears, hear the voices of Aquasplendere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His blood flows over our world. He is the origin of all life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As representatives of the Great Deaf bloodline, it falls to you to guide our people through the generations and to be the architects of our lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will bathe in a world where water, the blood of Aquasplendere, nourishes and guides us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/5a6b96d25d47715de2a947619ea94cb5.poster.avif?t=1749497160\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/5a6b96d25d47715de2a947619ea94cb5.webm?t=1749497160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/5a6b96d25d47715de2a947619ea94cb5.mp4?t=1749497160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to shape the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/577d5f73c3ac2512739295921d5a94c4.poster.avif?t=1749497160\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/577d5f73c3ac2512739295921d5a94c4.webm?t=1749497160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/577d5f73c3ac2512739295921d5a94c4.mp4?t=1749497160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to build our infrastructures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/898e16f876e39bc788e1419b01494106.poster.avif?t=1749497160\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/898e16f876e39bc788e1419b01494106.webm?t=1749497160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/898e16f876e39bc788e1419b01494106.mp4?t=1749497160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will give birth to your heirs who will succeed one by one to lead the Great Cohort to the next level. Our descendants will inherit the water we leave them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/48325510d3cfcd0df4fdfbfe55000ad3.poster.avif?t=1749497160\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/48325510d3cfcd0df4fdfbfe55000ad3.webm?t=1749497160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/48325510d3cfcd0df4fdfbfe55000ad3.mp4?t=1749497160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our bloodlines will be your ears, and you will choose the voices of Aquasplendere that will guide our path through the ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/81c434eb6e249a18a6488f7fa88d20d9.avif?t=1749497160\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is greater than Aquasplendere.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519340?t=1749497160","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/ad60cc1ad81bcbdbd3ae273646b5851e0f895317/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749497160","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/8708e334a42b3a73d945bc332edd923c25407a3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749497160","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/8708e334a42b3a73d945bc332edd923c25407a3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749497160","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We, the Ears, hear the voices of Aquasplendere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His blood flows over our world. He is the origin of all life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As representatives of the Great Deaf bloodline, it falls to you to guide our people through the generations and to be the architects of our lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will bathe in a world where water, the blood of Aquasplendere, nourishes and guides us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/5a6b96d25d47715de2a947619ea94cb5.poster.avif?t=1749497160\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519340/extras/5a6b96d25d47715de2a947619ea94cb5.webm?t=1749497160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35193